  "batch": "fce58a48-8774-4707-84d7-2c280fd877f1",
  "caveats": "Each ZIP download contains the original scanned TIFF files for a single calendar\nyear, including monthly and dekadal scans. The files are provided in a ZIP archive\nto preserve the original sources and may be extracted and converted as needed.\n\n\nCloud cover and atmospheric aerosols can sometimes interfere with optical satellite\nretrievals, although compositing techniques generally mitigate this. Extreme anomalies\nshould be cross-referenced with rainfall or soil moisture data to confirm drought\nas the cause rather than non-climatic factors like land-use change or locust infestations.",
